    "title": "Piano Journey : Play & Create",
    "description": "Piano Journey is an exciting and innovative game! It blends rhythmic gameplay with creative island-building, offering players a multi-layered experience where they can engage both musically and visually.\r\n\r\nWhat makes it stand out?\r\n\r\nHIGH-QUALITY MUSIC GAME:\r\n\ud83c\udfb5Variety of operations: Taps, Holds, and Swipes...... Let's catch the rhythm\r\n\ud83c\udfb5Diverse Music Library: Hundreds of hit songs, and constantly updated with fresh content\r\n\ud83c\udfb5Accessible Fun: Enjoyable for everyone, whether you're a rhythm game veteran or a casual player\r\n\r\nEXQUISITE VISUAL EFFECTS:\r\n\ud83c\udfb5Unique&Beautiful Island: Create and design your own music island!\r\n\ud83c\udfb5Exquisite Decoration: Variety of game scenes and visual effects\r\n\ud83c\udfb5Unique Arts: Cool design and bright 3D graphics\r\n\r\nMORE THAN A GAME:\r\n\ud83c\udfb5New Lifestyle: Piano Journey isn't just a game; it's a new way to experience music\r\n\ud83c\udfb5Challenge Yourself: It helps improve your hand speed and attention\r\n\r\nCome on! An unforgettable journey is waiting for you.\r\n\r\nSUPPORT:\r\nIf any producer or label has an issue with any of the music used in the game, please send email to us and it will be deleted immediately if necessary (this includes the images used).\r\n\r\nAre you having problems? Send an email to contact@orcat.sg",
